sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant UI as Search window
  participant Helper as Search helper
  participant Index as SQLite index

  You->>UI: type "invoice 2024"
  Note over UI: waits 100 ms for typing to pause
  UI->>Helper: query (JSON line)
  Helper->>Index: trigram lookup, every word must match
  Index-->>Helper: matching names
  Note over Helper: ranks exact names first,<br/>then apps, folders, other files
  Helper-->>UI: ranked results
  UI-->>You: list + preview of the top result
